OL,3,GNEWSAFamily may leave island over AI
OL,4,Ajob concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple says their family might leave
OL,7,FGuernsey after claiming artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI) contributed to them
OL,9,Flosing their jobs and left them
OL,10,Fstruggling to find work.
OL,12,FAnia and Patryk Pawleta said they
OL,13,Fworked at the same tech company since
OL,14,F2018, and were both let go at the start
OL,15,Fof 2026. Patryk was a software
OL,16,Fdeveloper and Ania was a product and
OL,17,Fimage administrator.
OL,19,FAnia said she was made redundant "as
OL,20,Fpart of wider redundancies" and was
OL,21,Ftold by a manager that her duties would
OL,22,Finstead be done by AI.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
