OL,3,GNEWSAFamily may leave island over AI
OL,4,Ajob concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatryk said the company blamed his
OL,7,Fredundancy on "market changes" and he
OL,8,Fhad to use AI "a lot towards the end"
OL,9,Fof his time at the firm. "AI is a
OL,10,Freason why I am struggling to find
OL,11,Fanother job," he said.
